  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Set the media <b>params</b> for a particular <b>face</b> on the <b>link</b>ed prim(s) without a delay.</p>
  <p>Returns a <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Integer/status" target="_blank">status</a> (an <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Integer" target="_blank">integer</a>) that is a STATUS_* flag which details the success/failure of the operation(s).</p>
</p>
